<title>TAJIKISTAN: Tajik Jan-Mar industry output falls 14.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Tajik Jan-Mar industry output falls 14.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>DUSHANBE 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tajikistan's industrial production in the first three months of this year was 14.5 percent lower than a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    TAJIKISTAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT    Jan-Mar 97   Jan-Mar 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	     -14.5	 -24.3</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
